[00:22.84]1. Nations align as one,
[00:27.62]Opposing Jehovah’s Son.
[00:31.88]Their time of human rulership
[00:36.60]By God’s decree now is done.
[00:41.70]Rulers have had their day;
[00:45.14]God’s Kingdom is here to stay.
[00:49.70]Soon Christ will crush earthly enemies.
[00:54.08]No more will there be delay.
[00:58.64](Chorus)
[00:58.82]Seek God for your deliverance,
[01:03.64]Yes, look to him with confidence.
[01:07.88]Seek his righteousness,
[01:09.94]Show your faithfulness,
[01:12.30]For his sov’reignty, take your stand.
[01:17.14]Then see our God deliver you
[01:21.52]By his mighty hand.
[01:28.24]2. People on earth now choose,
[01:29.24]Responding to this good news.
[01:49.28]We offer to all men the choice
[01:53.70]To hear or proudly refuse.
[01:57.86]Trials, although severe,
[02:02.18]Need not fill our hearts with fear.
[02:07.16]Jehovah cares for his loyal ones;
[02:11.34]Our cries for help he will hear.
[02:15.92](Chorus)
[02:16.16]Seek God for your deliverance,
[02:20.20]Yes, look to him with confidence.
[02:24.96]Seek his righteousness,
[02:27.06]Show your faithfulness,
[02:29.36]For his sov’reignty, take your stand.
[02:34.18]Then see our God deliver you
[02:38.44]By his mighty hand.
